  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "商業電腦套裝軟體",
    "sub_ename": "COMPUTER TOOLS FOR BUSINESS",
    "describe_ch": "The Computer Tools for Business course emphasizes on fundamental training in handling business data using popular computer softwares: Python and R. The course starts with teaching students how to use Python effectively as well as develop a good sense in algorithmic thinking.  The second part of course will focus on teaching students R language to analyze business data.  Student will also learn how to use data analysis library from the two softwares. Students will work on final projects to demonstrate how computer tools can solve business problems",
    "describe_eh": "The Computer Tools for Business course emphasizes on fundamental training in handling business data using popular computer softwares: Python and R. The course starts with teaching students how to use Python effectively as well as develop a good sense in algorithmic thinking.  The second part of course will focus on teaching students R language to analyze business data.  Student will also learn how to use data analysis library from the two softwares. Students will work on final projects to demonstrate how computer tools can solve business problems",
