      "soft_name": "Microsoft Excel:\n\nR: https://www.r-project.org/\n\nRstudio: https://posit.co/downloads/\n\nVisual Studio",
      "soft_memo": "<div><strong>R and Rstudo</strong>:&nbsp;Used predominantly in the R programming ecosystem, it allows for the seamless integration of analysis, results, and narration.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><strong>Visual Studio code</strong>: Visual Studio Code is a code editor redefined and optimized for building and debugging modern web and cloud applications.</div>\n",
      "soft_name_en": "Microsoft Excel:\n\n\nR:\nhttps://www.r-project.org/\n\nRstudio\nhttps://posit.co/downloads/\n\n\nVisual Studi",
      "soft_memo_en": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div><strong>Python</strong>: Python is a versatile, high-level programming language known for its readability and simplicity. Used in various applications, from web development to data science, it&#39;s favored for its vast library ecosystem and supportive community.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><strong>R and RMarkdown</strong>: RMarkdown is a document format that enables embedding of R code into markdown documents, facilitating dynamic report generation. Used predominantly in the R programming ecosystem, it allows for the seamless integration of analysis, results, and narration.</div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div><strong>Visual Studio code</strong>: Visual Studio Code is a code editor redefined and optimized for building and debugging modern web and cloud applications.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n"
    }
